WEBVTT

00:03:58.497 --> 00:04:00.497
(Tapping sounds)

00:04:03.597 --> 00:04:04.763
It was awesome.

00:04:07.363 --> 00:04:10.463
Skip over to Thanksgiving,
which means it's basically Christmas,

00:04:10.463 --> 00:04:12.463
so you might as well say it's a new year.

00:04:12.497 --> 00:04:13.897
Happy New Year 2020!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.697
Spoiler alert: things are
going to get wild --

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.863
fast.

00:04:17.897 --> 00:04:20.730
But I wasn't about to let
that 2020 paint get dry.